{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"北都馬拉松至少有23人送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/NORTH-INJURY-261101-1015.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】截至下午三時十分，北都馬拉松有23人需要送院。</p><p>身體不適的參賽者被送到北區醫院治理，有跑手需要由擔架床送入醫院，亦有跑手在救護員協助坐在輪椅上，再送入院內治理。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.751125+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T13:08:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:18.698062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:01.490946+00:00","content_hash":"5b215127c6632683540d679ec98f7c3a85ced0804dc41959c4f464cb22e172c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.751125+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}